            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore apa olasurai naa aing'en oleng alang ing'uesi pooki naaitobira Olaitoriani Enkai. Neikilikuan ninye enkitok ajoki, “Eji ketejo doi Enkai, ‘Eminya pooki ng'anayio lo lchani otii ena kurma?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki enkitok olasurai, “Aikiindim iyiook aainosa ilng'anayio pooki loo lkeek le nkurma, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake etejo Enkai, ‘Eminya ilo ng'anayioi leilo shani otii empolos enkurma, nimishoroo hoo ninye arashu iyeye.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaka olasurai enkitok, “Miyeye ntae; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu eyiolo Enkai ajo ore tininosinoso ninye nebolo inkonyek inyi, nitiuu anaa Enkai, niyiolouu isupati o ntorrok.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie edol enkitok ilo shani ajo sidai te ndaa, naa olchani sii oitiship inkonyek, naa olchani sii onguarrayu oiteng'en oltung'ani neitayu olng'anayioi lenyena neinos; neisho sii olpayian lenye embata, neinos ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore inkonyek e pokira nebolo, neyiolou ina kata aajo meishopo. Nerip mbenek olng'aboli aitaa nkilani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nening ninche oltoilo lo Laitoriani Enkai elo te nkurma eiropija enkolong. Ore olpayian o enkitok enye neisudori peyie medol Enkai tiatua ilkeek le nkurma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eipoto Olaitoriani Enkai ilo tungani nejoki ninye: “Kaji itii iyie?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neng'amaa ajoki, “Atoning'o oltoilo lino te nkurma, naureishoyu amu atoduaa ajo maishopo naipirri aisudori.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Enkai, “Aing'ae likitiaaka minchopo? Inosa o lng'anayioi lo lchani laitanapa apa intae ajoki eminya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ilo tung'ani, “Ore ina kitok apa nikinchoo metaa tenebo nanu, ninye naaishoo olng'anayioi lo lchani, mainosa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
