              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejo Olaitoriani Enkai, “Ng'ura, etotiwuo oltung'ani anaa obo lang etayiolo isidain o ntorrok; ore tena kata, neidim ninye aitorioki enkaina enye olchani le nkishui ainosa, neishu ninye intarasi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eitayio Olaitoriani Enkai ninye te nkurma e Eden peyie epuo aatur enkop apa naitobirunyeki ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nearaa ninye ilo tung'ani. Ore te nkalo oloo saen e Eden, etipika ninye olmalaika, o lalem oyupuyup oman pooki alo peyie errip enkoitoi olchani le nkishui.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.24"
            ]
          }
